N5008 [temp.spec.partial.order] across several shapes: declaration
order reversed, pointer depth (T** over T*), a fixed-arity template-id
pattern over a pack pattern (pack<A,B> over pack<X...>), reference
cv-qualification (const T& over T&); and [temp.spec.partial.match]/1:
the primary template never competes with a matching partial
specialisation (`un<T>` used to beat `un<pack<A,B>>` on the
parameter-count heuristic).
